   repository when reasonably possible.

2. No resale of Caligo itself. You may NOT sell, license, rent, or otherwise
   commercially redistribute Caligo as substantially the same product
   (same or trivially renamed game/app, same core loop and assets packaged
   as a competing or substitute product). Selling your own substantially
   original entertainment project that incorporates Caligo with meaningful
   modifications and proper attribution is allowed under Condition 1.

3. Share modifications when distributing. If you distribute a modified
   version, you must indicate that it is modified and not the official
   Caligo release.

4. Later compensation. The copyright holders reserve the right to contact
   you and request fair monetary compensation, a commercial license, or
